#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/delivery/next-iterations.md:38
msgid ""
"每次扩展先明确 owner、buffer、cancel/drain、ISR、deadline、对齐/cache 与停止 合同，再用 "
"GoogleTest/GoogleMock 做真实 RED→GREEN 的生产 provider 纵切片， 随后验证实际生成 factory、ARM "
"ELF、SDK 与物理边界。未选择模式不驻留资源， 不把不断扩大的通用对象成本摊到全部产品。"
msgstr ""
"Each extension first fixes owner, buffer, cancel/drain, ISR, deadline, "
"alignment/cache and stop contracts. Then use GoogleTest/GoogleMock for an "
"actual RED→GREEN production-provider vertical slice, followed by generated "
"factory, ARM ELF, SDK and physical-boundary verification. Unselected modes "
"retain no resources; growing generic-object costs are not imposed on every "
"product."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/delivery/next-iterations.md:43
msgid ""
"优先复用已有窄端口与静态装配；当现有合同无法表达硬件事实时允许明确版本化的 破坏性变更。Flash "
"认证、升级、制造密钥与工业安全政策属于外部产品／独立机制， 不能因已有 storage CRC 或 watchdog feed 就声称完成。"
msgstr ""
"Reuse existing narrow ports and static assembly first; allow explicitly "
"versioned breaking changes when contracts cannot express hardware facts. "
"Flash authentication, upgrades, manufacturing keys and industrial security "
"policy belong to external products/independent mechanisms. Existing storage "
"CRC or watchdog feed cannot establish their completion."

